WEBVTT

00:08.675 --> 00:11.769
<i>Magical Witch Punie- chan</i>

00:11.945 --> 00:14.880
<i>Spin that Princess Rod.</i>

00:15.181 --> 00:18.116
<i>She has descended
from the land of magic.</i>

00:18.451 --> 00:21.579
<i>Spin that magical stick.</i>

00:21.688 --> 00:24.680
<i>Pleased to meet you, Punie Tanaka.</i>

00:24.891 --> 00:31.353
<i>Lightning, sweep, exterminate,
use your powers and rule the world.</i>

00:31.498 --> 00:36.299
<i>Don't trust those kind
words and nice smiles.</i>

00:39.672 --> 00:45.474
<i>Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all.</i>

00:45.779 --> 00:52.412
<i>I will take you to the land of paradise.</i>

00:52.685 --> 00:58.749
<i>Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all.</i>

00:58.858 --> 01:07.664
<i>There's only one way
to survive, and that is to fight.</i>

01:15.241 --> 01:26.311
<i>There's only one path that leads
to supremacy, and that is by fighting.</i>

01:37.730 --> 01:40.631
Why, Punie Tanaka-kun?

01:42.469 --> 01:43.800
Principal...

01:44.170 --> 01:49.301
My time here on Earth is almost up.

01:50.009 --> 01:55.174
While I'm here, I want to make
as many fun memories as I can...

01:59.052 --> 02:02.988
You want to be on the sports
festival's executive committee?

02:06.025 --> 02:09.119
I'm sorry if I sound too selfish...

02:10.964 --> 02:12.329
I can't, right?

02:17.270 --> 02:19.295
No problem!

02:20.006 --> 02:22.031
Go and do your best!

02:23.810 --> 02:29.816
<i>Episode 7: Don't Think Participation
Is Important. That's Too Lenient.</i>

02:29.816 --> 02:33.786
<i>Sports Festival</i>

02:33.786 --> 02:34.320
White Team Red Team

02:34.320 --> 02:36.845
White Team Red Team
The girls' spoon race will start soon.

02:36.956 --> 02:39.550
Participants, head to the gate now.

02:39.659 --> 02:43.652
What's the matter, Anego-san?
Hurry up and go to the gate.

02:43.763 --> 02:46.197
Look at the executive committee.

02:46.966 --> 02:49.867
The witch is smiling with
a perfectly straight face.

02:49.969 --> 02:50.867
What?

02:50.937 --> 02:52.199
You didn't know?

02:52.305 --> 02:56.639
Every event for today's sports
festival is being produced by Punie.

02:58.278 --> 03:02.009
This year's sports festival
is gonna get a little ugly.

03:03.716 --> 03:06.412
Coming up is
the second-year girls' spoon race.

03:06.853 --> 03:09.014
On your mark, paya.

03:09.122 --> 03:10.214
Ready...

03:11.658 --> 03:13.023
Bang!

03:15.261 --> 03:17.491
Wow! Anego-san is really fast!

03:17.597 --> 03:20.464
She's in first place!
She's far ahead of the others!

03:20.567 --> 03:22.398
This is too easy...

03:26.105 --> 03:28.938
These are eggs prepared by Punie.

03:35.949 --> 03:38.543
It's possible. With her, anything is.

03:39.118 --> 03:40.244
Excuse me.

03:40.720 --> 03:43.712
Freight train is connected.
Ready to go!

03:43.823 --> 03:44.657
Hey!

03:44.657 --> 03:47.023
Hey!
Choo-choo! Choo-choo!

03:47.293 --> 03:49.022
Don't, Tetsuko! That egg...

03:49.162 --> 03:52.495
The red team's
Tetsuko Koku is in first place!

03:53.166 --> 03:54.326
I did it!

03:56.135 --> 03:59.104
Maybe you're just
thinking too much, Anego.

04:03.009 --> 04:04.840
A regular egg?

04:05.845 --> 04:10.043
<i>Executive Committee Member</i>

04:10.483 --> 04:13.384
H-Her eyes are so calm.

04:14.587 --> 04:18.819
Don't tell me she'll do
this sports festival fair and square.

04:32.739 --> 04:36.470
Go! Go! Red team!
Go! Go! Red team!

04:47.220 --> 04:49.415
Big Sister!

04:49.822 --> 04:52.154
Pyun, Potaru, what is it?

04:52.258 --> 04:54.192
We made some lunch.

04:54.294 --> 04:55.659
Let's eat.

04:55.762 --> 04:57.627
Wow! Thank you.

04:57.730 --> 04:59.322
Yay! Yay!

04:59.499 --> 05:02.900
You delinquent women,
there's enough for you too.

05:03.002 --> 05:05.300
You should be grateful, pig.

05:05.405 --> 05:06.702
Thanks...

05:08.608 --> 05:11.099
Bon appétit!

05:11.344 --> 05:13.141
Wow! This is amazing!

05:13.246 --> 05:15.237
They look good...

05:18.384 --> 05:20.318
Aren't you going to eat?

05:20.420 --> 05:22.251
Looks like they're not poisoned.

05:22.355 --> 05:23.523
I'm a taste tester?

05:23.523 --> 05:25.514
I'm a taste tester?
Hey, Big Sister!

05:25.625 --> 05:28.253
We want to be
in the sports festival too!

05:28.361 --> 05:30.226
Sure, that's fine.

05:30.330 --> 05:33.527
You're sure?
It's dangerous for small kids.

05:33.900 --> 05:37.631
It's my first time experiencing
something this wonderful.

05:37.737 --> 05:40.399
I want to let them participate as well.

05:40.506 --> 05:42.531
Trying to be a goody-goody...

05:42.642 --> 05:45.475
You're planning to win
at the end with magic, right?

05:47.313 --> 05:50.578
After becoming
an executive committee member...

05:50.683 --> 05:54.244
...and researching
the sports festival, I understood.

05:54.354 --> 05:57.949
There are many wonderful
cultures here on Earth.

05:58.057 --> 06:01.390
I was about to head
home to the land of magic...

06:01.494 --> 06:04.463
...without experiencing any of them.

06:05.498 --> 06:06.726
Punie...

06:06.833 --> 06:07.800
Anego-san.

06:08.468 --> 06:13.064
The mock cavalry battle at the end...
Will you compete earnestly with me?

06:13.172 --> 06:16.300
I won't use magic.
I'll compete fair and square.

06:17.009 --> 06:19.944
I want to have
good memories with you.

06:25.885 --> 06:29.787
I'm going to take
that bandana off your head.

06:31.357 --> 06:32.825
I won't lose.

06:32.825 --> 06:36.829
<i>Victory for White Team
The mock cavalry battle starts now.</i>

06:36.829 --> 06:37.296
<i>White Team Red Team</i>

06:37.296 --> 06:39.832
<i>White Team Red Team
Goodness, the teams are tied.</i>

06:39.832 --> 06:41.060
Goodness, the teams are tied.

06:42.568 --> 06:44.934
Here comes the red team!

06:55.481 --> 06:59.042
And now, here comes the white team!

06:59.385 --> 07:00.784
Come on, Puni...

07:00.887 --> 07:02.286
What?

07:02.388 --> 07:02.789
<i>Punie</i>

07:02.789 --> 07:03.756
<i>Punie
Punie Cavalry!</i>

07:03.756 --> 07:04.780
Punie Cavalry!

07:06.826 --> 07:09.260
The White Rose Squad is here!

07:09.629 --> 07:11.722
You brought a real cavalry?

07:12.432 --> 07:17.028
This is your first battle.
Look well at how your sister fights.

07:17.136 --> 07:18.728
Yes, Big Sister!

07:19.038 --> 07:21.302
Shout for victory!

07:34.520 --> 07:35.953
Charge!

07:43.496 --> 07:45.464
Anego, here they come!

07:45.565 --> 07:48.125
Damn! Pull back! Retreat!

07:52.071 --> 07:55.973
Come on, come on, come on!

08:00.646 --> 08:02.375
I got him!

08:04.250 --> 08:06.218
I-I did it, master!

08:06.586 --> 08:08.554
Well done on the first strike.

08:08.654 --> 08:10.246
A Godiva truffle!

08:10.356 --> 08:13.223
I'm expecting you to do more.

08:13.326 --> 08:16.295
Go and get more.
Respond with more action.

08:16.395 --> 08:17.362
Yes, ma'am!

08:17.730 --> 08:20.426
With great physical strength!

08:22.235 --> 08:27.172
One after another, our army
is taking down the enemy.

08:27.273 --> 08:30.071
Victory is only a matter of time.

08:30.510 --> 08:31.534
So...

08:33.713 --> 08:34.975
I see.

08:35.081 --> 08:37.174
Huh? What's she doing?

08:37.283 --> 08:39.581
She's definitely off guard.

08:39.986 --> 08:41.454
Time to strike.

08:41.454 --> 08:43.022
<i>Punie</i>

08:43.022 --> 08:44.887
Pyun & Potaru

08:45.558 --> 08:47.287
Start the horses!

08:47.393 --> 08:50.362
Our enemies are on the athletic field!

08:50.763 --> 08:52.697
Take the old traitor's head!

08:52.798 --> 08:56.063
Great God!
Help us defeat our enemy!

09:01.641 --> 09:03.199
Who the hell?

09:04.010 --> 09:04.999
What?

09:05.244 --> 09:07.678
T-They attacked our weak flank...

09:08.281 --> 09:10.909
What? What about the reserves?

09:11.117 --> 09:14.575
Pyun-dono and Potaru-dono
are rebelling against us!

09:14.687 --> 09:17.019
Our army is getting defeated!

09:17.123 --> 09:18.522
Stop fussing!

09:18.624 --> 09:19.682
Master!

09:19.792 --> 09:24.229
Damn you...
You backstabbed your sister!

09:25.498 --> 09:27.523
First and second troops, flank right!

09:27.633 --> 09:30.602
Join the third troop
and create a circle formation!

09:30.703 --> 09:32.136
Attack both sides!

09:32.238 --> 09:35.332
You delinquent woman,
you should give yourself up.

09:35.808 --> 09:38.800
What? Punie's army
seems to be in disarray.

09:38.911 --> 09:40.276
Guys, now!

09:48.287 --> 09:50.585
Don't think you're better than us...

09:51.691 --> 09:54.251
...just because you're on a horse!

09:54.627 --> 09:56.254
Why you!

09:57.730 --> 09:59.220
That's dangerous!

10:10.977 --> 10:12.945
How many allies survived?

10:13.713 --> 10:17.205
It is only you and myself, master.

10:20.319 --> 10:24.187
There's no escape for you now.
You used such a dirty trick...

10:24.890 --> 10:25.948
Get ready.

10:26.025 --> 10:26.992
Paya!

10:32.765 --> 10:33.666
Payatan!

10:33.666 --> 10:34.928
Payatan!
Please flee!

10:35.034 --> 10:37.093
Let me handle this!

10:37.203 --> 10:39.865
I'll see you again
at the river of the dead!

10:40.272 --> 10:42.866
Payatan! Payatan!

11:12.605 --> 11:15.665
I'm sorry, Payatan... It's all my fault...

11:16.042 --> 11:18.875
After her! Don't let the witch escape!

11:19.111 --> 11:23.571
I guess the era of
close combat has already ended...

11:24.583 --> 11:26.050
From now on...

11:27.787 --> 11:29.277
From now on...

11:31.190 --> 11:33.090
...it's the era of guns.

11:36.028 --> 11:37.495
Muskets!

11:37.663 --> 11:38.857
Fire!

11:42.401 --> 11:43.333
Next!

11:43.502 --> 11:44.867
Fire!

12:00.419 --> 12:02.910
Afterwards, this battle...

12:03.022 --> 12:08.221
...became known as the first time
guns were used in battle in Japan.

12:08.327 --> 12:12.593
It marked its place in
the history of sports festivals.

12:13.966 --> 12:17.197
This was already
a major event anyway...

12:50.870 --> 12:53.100
Take that! Take that!

12:53.205 --> 12:55.036
Bad girls!

12:55.541 --> 12:57.372
Take that! Take that!

13:01.046 --> 13:03.241
I baked the cupcakes, Potaru.

13:03.649 --> 13:05.344
Looks delicious!

13:05.451 --> 13:09.251
I made it to this recipe,
but I wonder if I did it right.

13:09.622 --> 13:11.522
Bon appétit!

13:15.094 --> 13:15.992
Wow!

13:16.095 --> 13:17.460
Delicious.

13:25.805 --> 13:27.636
Here it comes!

13:27.740 --> 13:29.867
It worked, Potaru.

13:29.975 --> 13:32.273
We'll get Big Sister with this...

13:38.317 --> 13:41.286
<i>Episode 8:
We Can't Just Stay the Way We Are.</i>

13:41.387 --> 13:44.288
<i>It's Kind of Scary
Becoming an Adult.</i>

13:44.990 --> 13:47.584
Good morning,
Anego-san, Tetsuko-chan!

13:47.693 --> 13:48.625
Paya!

13:48.727 --> 13:49.461
Yo.

13:49.461 --> 13:51.122
Yo.
Morning, Punie-chan.

13:51.230 --> 13:53.323
It's another lovely day.

13:57.236 --> 13:59.602
Huh? What's going on?

14:09.081 --> 14:10.070
Gorgeous.

14:10.182 --> 14:12.878
I can't control myself anymore!

14:14.453 --> 14:15.920
They're pretty.

14:16.155 --> 14:17.645
Are they celebrities?

14:17.756 --> 14:19.656
Maybe a photo shoot?

14:19.758 --> 14:23.626
I'm jealous. I wish I were like them.

14:23.729 --> 14:29.099
Don't worry, Tetsuko-chan. You have
boobs that are like a super bullet train.

14:29.235 --> 14:30.327
You think?

14:30.436 --> 14:32.734
Let's go. We'll be late.

14:34.306 --> 14:37.798
Oh, so you'll just pass right by us?

14:37.910 --> 14:39.878
Big Sister...

14:41.881 --> 14:43.405
Big Sister?

14:43.883 --> 14:45.851
Don't tell me you two...

14:46.585 --> 14:48.519
...are Pyun and Potaru?

14:49.755 --> 14:51.882
How did you become adults?

14:51.991 --> 14:55.324
We saw the "Book of the Dead"
on a Yahoo auction.

14:55.427 --> 14:58.362
And that book had
an arcana of growth.

14:59.098 --> 15:02.124
Big Sister... No, turd-Punie...

15:02.234 --> 15:04.964
Do you know
why we couldn't beat you?

15:07.940 --> 15:10.033
Oh? I wonder what's wrong?

15:10.142 --> 15:13.270
She's shaking like an innocent girl.

15:14.113 --> 15:15.603
She knows.

15:15.714 --> 15:19.480
The reason why
we couldn't beat this delinquent...

15:20.052 --> 15:21.986
...is because we were little!

15:22.655 --> 15:25.453
Princess Gemini Monkey Flip!

15:27.626 --> 15:28.327
Punie-chan!

15:28.327 --> 15:29.191
Punie-chan!
Punie!

15:29.295 --> 15:31.422
Gemini Knee Drop!

15:33.565 --> 15:35.396
Gemini Drop Kick!

15:35.834 --> 15:38.268
Gemini Pile Driver!

15:40.439 --> 15:42.430
Gemini Hell Strike!

15:48.314 --> 15:49.781
Gemini...

15:51.417 --> 15:52.975
...Guillotine!

15:59.758 --> 16:00.952
They're strong!

16:01.727 --> 16:04.594
Their magical and
physical power is greater.

16:04.697 --> 16:07.962
They're undoubtedly
the strongest foes.

16:13.138 --> 16:14.867
This is bad! This is bad!

16:14.974 --> 16:17.374
My lovely daughters
are killing each other!

16:17.476 --> 16:19.910
Ouch! My stomach...

16:20.112 --> 16:21.136
Darling.

16:21.880 --> 16:27.147
Do you know why I was
able to become the queen?

16:27.353 --> 16:30.811
Because you're the strongest
witch in the land of magic.

16:30.923 --> 16:32.686
Not at all.

16:33.892 --> 16:38.192
There were many witches
whom were stronger than me.

16:38.297 --> 16:41.664
Akko, Sally, Meg...

16:42.334 --> 16:44.632
And Momo.

16:45.938 --> 16:49.305
The reason I was
able to become queen...

16:51.410 --> 16:55.210
...is because I kept beating those
whom were stronger than me.

16:58.717 --> 17:03.711
In order to become the queen, you
need strength plus something else.

17:09.461 --> 17:10.928
This is bad...

17:11.430 --> 17:13.364
I don't think I can win...

17:13.465 --> 17:16.798
We'll forget what you
did to us, rotten punk.

17:16.902 --> 17:19.962
We won't take time
beating you to death.

17:20.072 --> 17:22.939
We'll kill you quickly, ugly bitch.

17:23.742 --> 17:25.471
Listen to yourselves...

17:25.577 --> 17:28.978
I can't believe
you're showing me mercy...

17:30.682 --> 17:37.178
With your powers, you can
kill me and Queen Esmeralda...

17:37.322 --> 17:40.985
...and have the land of magic
in the palm of your hands.

17:41.360 --> 17:43.555
But after that...

17:44.830 --> 17:47.355
...which one will be the queen?

17:48.367 --> 17:50.164
Only one can.

17:55.507 --> 17:57.407
It doesn't matter!

18:01.947 --> 18:05.144
Only one of us
will profit from this, Potaru.

18:05.584 --> 18:09.520
You can kill me and Pyun
at the same time now, Potaru.

18:12.391 --> 18:13.881
What's wrong, Pyun?

18:13.992 --> 18:14.893
Nothing...

18:14.893 --> 18:16.417
Nothing...
She did it.

18:16.528 --> 18:19.156
She's a scary individual, as usual.

18:19.264 --> 18:20.322
How so?

18:20.432 --> 18:22.593
The twin attacks...

18:22.701 --> 18:26.262
Which part do you think
is most problematic?

18:28.307 --> 18:30.400
The high-spirited combo play.

18:30.943 --> 18:32.433
But look now.

18:32.544 --> 18:36.640
With a word or two, she placed
doubt into the twins' minds.

18:36.748 --> 18:39.410
Now they can't use combo play.

18:39.985 --> 18:41.350
Crafty!

18:41.587 --> 18:44.351
Unprincesslike craftiness.

18:45.491 --> 18:49.086
Could she be the true witch?

18:52.364 --> 18:53.592
Payatan?

18:53.699 --> 18:55.257
Interesting.

18:55.367 --> 18:57.733
You're definitely interesting.

18:58.170 --> 19:02.436
I, Payatan, will follow
you to the depths of hell.

19:05.177 --> 19:06.872
Don't be overwhelmed.

19:06.979 --> 19:10.608
Submission holds
are meant for one-on-one combat.

19:11.049 --> 19:13.711
That choke sleeper
before proved it, right?

19:13.819 --> 19:18.085
That certainly is the greatest
weakness of submission holds.

19:18.323 --> 19:23.420
But I've been practicing how to fight
one on two for the last eight years.

19:23.729 --> 19:25.424
Eight years ago?

19:25.531 --> 19:28.694
Wait a minute!
We're only eight years old!

19:28.934 --> 19:29.923
That means...

19:30.035 --> 19:32.731
When we were born into this world...

19:32.838 --> 19:35.432
You were ready to fight both of us?

19:36.008 --> 19:37.202
That's right.

19:37.309 --> 19:41.473
I came up with this technique
in order to fight you twins.

19:41.580 --> 19:44.242
In other words, it's sisterly love.

19:45.050 --> 19:46.950
Accept your sister's love!

20:00.199 --> 20:01.166
Princess...

20:01.300 --> 20:02.665
No!

20:03.235 --> 20:05.226
...Spinning Toe Hold!

20:27.159 --> 20:28.183
The finish.

20:31.797 --> 20:34.493
Princess Forty-four Magnum!

20:36.668 --> 20:39.136
We were wrong! We should've...

20:39.238 --> 20:41.832
...never made her our enemy!

20:45.577 --> 20:46.635
Huh?

20:47.279 --> 20:49.713
The arcana's effects wore off.

20:50.616 --> 20:53.244
I won't forgive you
just because it wore off.

20:53.352 --> 20:54.717
Big Sister...

20:55.621 --> 20:58.351
Your punishment is just beginning.

21:03.996 --> 21:06.021
Punie-chan, please forgive them!

21:06.131 --> 21:07.928
I won't forgive you!

21:08.033 --> 21:09.796
Tickle, tickle, tickle!

21:15.107 --> 21:16.597
Punie-chan...

21:26.351 --> 21:30.219
Looks like the land of magic
will be peaceful for a while...

21:32.157 --> 21:34.250
The End

21:51.410 --> 21:59.249
<i>If you bend the knees upside down...</i>

21:59.518 --> 22:06.890
<i>...even your belief about
crushing a rock becomes distorted.</i>

22:07.526 --> 22:15.023
<i>Good, justice, and even the truth
is gone when you feel the pain.</i>

22:15.133 --> 22:23.541
<i>Even those with fortitude have joints.</i>

22:23.675 --> 22:31.548
<i>Take a look. This is
the submission of a monarch.</i>

22:31.717 --> 22:44.187
<i>As long as you
have fortitude, you will prosper.</i>
